+
+Use a fresh preparation directory and job name for every run. The explicit
+`--binary` selects the canonical repository binary instead of the wrapper's
+isolated-runner default. This task's wrapper is fixed to logical device 10 and
+its physical identity; it checks occupancy, the shared lock, timeout and the
+remaining cumulative device budget before submitting through `device_job.py`.
+Do not bypass a failed device or budget check. The helper lives at the absolute
+path shown above and must accompany the task's reproduction artifacts; it is not
+a generic command installed by this repository.
+
+The example deliberately remains the one-instance, full-core baseline. See the
+[final acceptance report](../../docs/bge/acceptance.md) for the delivered instance,
+core and precision settings and their artifact identities; a search result is
+not the final recommendation. Formal performance must report
+`status=success`, `statistics_sufficient=true`,
+`latency_scope=h2d_desc_execute_sync_d2h` and `capture_enabled=false`. Run pressure
+capture separately and compare every request against the unchanged references.
+
+Preparation does not establish that the selected device is free and has no
